<AddOnInstructionDefinition Name="Chassis_CamPos_Check" Class="Standard" Revision="2.0" Vendor="Steven Douglas Corp." ExecutePrescan="false" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2010-03-29T16:58:02.278Z" CreatedBy="Not Available" EditedDate="2021-03-29T19:21:51.685Z" EditedBy="STEVENDOUGLAS\wehamby"
 SoftwareRevision="v32.02">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Cam position check for triggering devices.]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[Added Timing Advance Feature-W.E.H. 09/2018]]>
</RevisionNote>
<AdditionalHelpText>
<![CDATA[This Instruction uses a 360 Degree position signal from the Chassis Main Cam to be used as a wat to trigger devices/events. The input signal (Cam position) is given a window to accomodate the changing of the position. When the desired position is within the window, the output is triggered with a One Shot.]]>
</AdditionalHelpText>
<Parameters>
<Parameter Name="EnableIn" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Input" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Enable Input - System Defined Parameter]]>
</Description>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="EnableOut" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Enable Output - System Defined Parameter]]>
</Description>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="CamPosTrig" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Usage="Input" Radix="Float" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write">
<Description>
<![CDATA[The desired position to trigger]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="ChassisDataCamPos" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Usage="Input" Radix="Float" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Cam Position From Chassis Data Cam Pos
(Actual Cam Position)]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="EnableTimingAdvance" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Usage="Input" Radix="Decimal" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[1=On 0=Off]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="ChassisRunVelocity" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Usage="Input" Radix="Float" Required="true" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="LowLim" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Usage="Output" Radix="Float" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="CorrectedCamPosTrig" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Usage="Output" Radix="Float" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read/Write">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Degree position that the trigger occurs]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="HighLim" TagType="Base" DataType="REAL" Usage="Output" Radix="Float" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
</Parameters>
<LocalTags>
<LocalTag Name="OneShot" DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Oneshot the output]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="InPositionWindow" DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="AmountOfCorrection" DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0.00000000e+000]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="REAL" Radix="Float" Value="0.0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
</LocalTags>
<Routines>
<Routine Name="Logic" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Timing Advance feature was incorporated using a parabolic relationship between the speed of the Chassis and change in cam trigger position.
The equation chosen for his was a horizontal parabola with the equation x=a(y)^2+h where the y-axis is the amount (degrees) of timing advance, and the x-axis is the speed in Deg/Sec. of the Chassis.
A parabola allows for the timing advance to only start after the chassis is moving at a minimum speed and then become more drastic as the speed increases.
The "h" in the equation is the speed of the Chassis where the correction will start changing. 100 Deg/Sec will be chosen. To solve for the "a", the value of 15 Deg ( y-axis) correction at a speed of 360 Deg/sec.(x-Axis) was chosen.
This yields an "a" value of 1.156.
So the equation for correction then becomes x=1.156 y^2 + 100
To solve for y it becomes y = sqrt(0.865x - 86.5) .]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(EnableIn)[NE(EnableTimingAdvance,1) MOVE(CamPosTrig,CorrectedCamPosTrig) ,EQ(EnableTimingAdvance,1) [GE(ChassisRunVelocity,100) CPT(AmountOfCorrection,SQRT((0.865*ChassisRunVelocity)- 86.5)) ,LT(ChassisRunVelocity,100) MOVE(0,AmountOfCorrection) ] SUB(CamPosTrig,AmountOfCorrection,CorrectedCamPosTrig) [GE(CorrectedCamPosTrig,0) ,LT(CorrectedCamPosTrig,0) ADD(360.0,CorrectedCamPosTrig,CorrectedCamPosTrig) ] ]SUB(CorrectedCamPosTrig,2.0,LowLim)ADD(CorrectedCamPosTrig,5.0,HighLim)[LE(HighLim,360.0) GE(LowLim,0.0) LIMIT(LowLim,ChassisDataCamPos,HighLim) ,[GT(HighLim,360.0) SUB(HighLim,360.0,HighLim) ,LT(LowLim,0.0) ADD(360.0,LowLim,LowLim) ] [LIMIT(LowLim,ChassisDataCamPos,360.0) ,LIMIT(0,ChassisDataCamPos,HighLim) ] ]OTE(InPositionWindow)ONS(OneShot)OTE(EnableOut);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</AddOnInstructionDefinition>
<AddOnInstructionDefinition Name="CPU_TimeDate_wJulian" Class="Standard" Revision="2.2" Vendor="SDC" ExecutePrescan="false" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2014-05-01T14:06:05.139Z" CreatedBy="RA-INT\anabuto" EditedDate="2025-07-14T15:17:12.357Z" EditedBy="STEVENDOUGLAS\jperry"
 SoftwareRevision="v37.00">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Get CPU Time And Date. Calculates Day number from Jan 1 for Julian Day. Get UTC in microseconds.]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[2.0:  Added UTC functionality
2.1:  -Fixed non-functioning milliseconds
 -updated timedate UDT to add system clock microseconds
1-5-21 Dan Garr
v2.2 Cleaned up unused tags and optimized all data types for mem usage. 2021-05-11 D.E.S.]]>
</RevisionNote>
<Parameters>
<Parameter Name="EnableIn" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Input" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Enable Input - System Defined Parameter]]>
</Description>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="EnableOut" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="false" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Enable Output - System Defined Parameter]]>
</Description>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="JulianDate" TagType="Base" DataType="INT" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[ordinal date]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="INT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="TimeDateTag" TagType="Base" DataType="CPU_TimeDate" Usage="InOut" Required="true" Visible="true" Constant="false"/>
</Parameters>
<LocalTags>
<LocalTag Name="Month" DataType="SINT" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="SINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="LookUp" DataType="INT" Dimensions="13" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[[0,0,31,59,90,120,151,181,212,243,273,304,334]]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<Array DataType="INT" Dimensions="13" Radix="Decimal">
<Element Index="[0]" Value="0"/>
<Element Index="[1]" Value="0"/>
<Element Index="[2]" Value="31"/>
<Element Index="[3]" Value="59"/>
<Element Index="[4]" Value="90"/>
<Element Index="[5]" Value="120"/>
<Element Index="[6]" Value="151"/>
<Element Index="[7]" Value="181"/>
<Element Index="[8]" Value="212"/>
<Element Index="[9]" Value="243"/>
<Element Index="[10]" Value="273"/>
<Element Index="[11]" Value="304"/>
<Element Index="[12]" Value="334"/>
</Array>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="TimeDateArray" DataType="DINT" Dimensions="7" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[[0,0,0,0,0,0,0]]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<Array DataType="DINT" Dimensions="7" Radix="Decimal">
<Element Index="[0]" Value="0"/>
<Element Index="[1]" Value="0"/>
<Element Index="[2]" Value="0"/>
<Element Index="[3]" Value="0"/>
<Element Index="[4]" Value="0"/>
<Element Index="[5]" Value="0"/>
<Element Index="[6]" Value="0"/>
</Array>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
</LocalTags>
<Routines>
<Routine Name="Logic" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[GSV(WallClockTime,,LocalDateTime,TimeDateArray[0]);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[CLR(JulianDate)MOVE(TimeDateArray[1],Month);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[LIMIT(1,Month,12)ADD(LookUp[Month],TimeDateArray[2],JulianDate);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[GT(TimeDateArray[1],2)CMP(((TimeDateArray[0] MOD 4) = 0))[CMP(((TimeDateArray[0] MOD 100) > 0)) ,CMP(((TimeDateArray[0] MOD 400) = 0)) ]ADD(JulianDate,1,JulianDate);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOVE(TimeDateArray[0],TimeDateTag.Year)MOVE(TimeDateArray[1],TimeDateTag.Month)MOVE(TimeDateArray[2],TimeDateTag.Day)MOVE(TimeDateArray[3],TimeDateTag.Hour)MOVE(TimeDateArray[4],TimeDateTag.Minutes)MOVE(TimeDateArray[5],TimeDateTag.Seconds)DIV(TimeDateArray[6],1000,TimeDateTag.Milliseconds)MOVE(TimeDateArray[6],TimeDateTag.Microseconds);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[GSV(TimeSynchronize,,CurrentTimeMicroseconds,TimeDateTag.UTCMicroseconds);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</AddOnInstructionDefinition>
