<Routine Name="R01_Inputs" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Mapped/debounced inputs]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Logic inputs

*Replace always off bits with real conditions]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_ManualMode)XIO(HMI_LocalManualOverride)OTE(ManualMode);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_SafetyOK)OTE(SafetyOK);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_FaultReset)OTE(FaultReset);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_CycleStartLatch)OTE(CycleRunning);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\Supervisor.q_CycleStartLatch)OTE(CycleStopping);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_CycleStopped)ONS(ONS.0)XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOff)OTE(CycleStopped);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOff)OTE(Initialized);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_AutoJog)OTE(AutoJog);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_ManualJogChassis)OTE(ChassisControl.JogChassis);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_AutoJogging)OTE(ChassisControl.AutoJogChassis);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_AutoJoggingReady)OTE(AutoJoggingReady);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Pause condition examples: feeder bowl low levels, infeed conveyor empty, outfeed conveyor full]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(\S01_PartLoad.q_PauseRequest) MOVE(1,PauseReason) ,XIC(\S19_PartUnload.q_PauseRequest) MOVE(2,PauseReason) ]OTE(PauseCondition);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Cam Velocity For Status (In Degrees/Sec)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[MUL(iq_CamAxis.ActualVelocity,10000,CamAxisActVelREALTemp)TRUNC(CamAxisActVelREALTemp,CamAxisActVelREALTemp)DIV(CamAxisActVelREALTemp,10000,ChassisStatus.ActualVelocity);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Resync Required]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[7])[XIO(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation) ,XIO(ChassisStatus.CamInDialDwell) ]XIO(i_HandCrank)XIO(ChassisControl.ImmedStop)XIC(ChassisControl.DialIndexPermsOK)OTE(ChassisStatus.ResyncRequired);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Chassis Dial Index Permissives : 
These are the conditions that cause the Dial to crash if not made during Indexing (ex. a cylinder that is inserted into a nest during dwell, but will interfere if not retracted during the dial index)
Use sensors and/or other conditions as the permissives.

NOTE: If any of these permissives are not made when the dial indexes (and a little bit before), the Chassis will Immediately Stop (NOT move to startup location) and cause a fault. A fault condition in the logic will cause the camming to be disabled and the servo to quickly stop independently.
See the Index Permissives fault for more explanation of this condition.

ADDITIONAL NOTE: These permissives typicaly will show when a station/condition is not complete when the dial gets ready to index. Therefore, it is a good idea to generate a fault message for each bit condition in order to help determine the cause
of the index permissives fault.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOn) OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus[0]) ,XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOn) OTE(IndexPermissiveStatus[1]) ,XIC(IndexPermissiveStatus[0]) XIC(IndexPermissiveStatus[1]) OTE(ChassisControl.DialIndexPermsOK) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Chassis Immediate Stop Conditions : 
These are the conditions that cause the Chassis to Immediately Stop (NOT move to startup location). 
This condition will NOT cause a Chassis fault. 

NOTE:Since this does fault the logic the cam and dial remain cammed together, but stop quickly

These should be faults that occur on the machine that require the chassis to stop at its current location or as soon as possible. These condtions cannot wait for the chassis to continue to the starting location as normal faults do.
Typically these are faults for devices that cause an interference with the dial as it indexes. They probably are the same devices that have been used in the index permissive string. The difference is that the index permissives are checked WHILE the dial is indexing (and a little bit before),
while the immediate stop conditions are always monitored during chassis cam motion.
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOff)OTE(ChassisControl.ImmedStop);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Clear HMI Manual Triggers]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ChassisControl.Resync)TON(hmitimer,?,?)XIC(hmitimer.DN)OTU(ChassisControl.Resync);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R02_PositionCalcs" Type="RLL">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Calculates Cam And Dial Posiitons For Status And Dial Status Bits]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calculate Cam Position for Status
Note : The value is multiplied and divided to remove scientific notation and create a fixed number of decimal places. ]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[MUL(iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,10000,CamAxisPosDegREALTemp)TRUNC(CamAxisPosDegREALTemp,CamAxisPosDegREALTemp)DIV(CamAxisPosDegREALTemp,10000,ChassisStatus.CamPosDeg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calculate Dial Position For Status (In Degrees)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[MUL(iq_DialAxis.ActualPosition,10000,DialAxisPosDegREALTemp)TRUNC(DialAxisPosDegREALTemp,DialAxisPosDegREALTemp)DIV(DialAxisPosDegREALTemp,10000,ChassisStatus.DialPosDeg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calculate Dial Position For Status (Scaled To Nests)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(DialAxisPosNestsREALTemp,(iq_DialAxis.ActualPosition*p_SetupNestQty/360.0)+1)MUL(DialAxisPosNestsREALTemp,10000,DialAxisPosNestsREALTemp)TRUNC(DialAxisPosNestsREALTemp,DialAxisPosNestsREALTemp)DIV(DialAxisPosNestsREALTemp,10000,ChassisStatus.DialPosNests);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calculate The On Station Tolerance Scaled To Nests

Note 1 : On Station Tolerance is given to this Program in degrees. The OnStaTol must be converted to nests in order to find the compare window for being on a station. 

Note 2 : The OnStaTol gets multiplied and divided in order to remove scientific notation and to give the value a fixed number of decimal places.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(OnStaTolNstsREALTemp,SetupOnStaTolDeg*p_SetupNestQty/360.0)MUL(OnStaTolNstsREALTemp,10000,OnStaTolNstsREALTemp)TRUNC(OnStaTolNstsREALTemp,OnStaTolNstsREALTemp)DIV(OnStaTolNstsREALTemp,10000,OnStationTolNests);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Populate the tracking data with the nest numbers at all stations around the dial. This logic is placed here to prevent scan order issues. (It is closest to the servo position)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(R03_CalcDialStationNestNums,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calculate Cam Position For Forward/Reverse Resync When Dial is On Station

Calculate Cam Position For Forward/Reverse Resync When Dial Was Not On Station.
By the Time This is Used the Dial Has Already Been Synced to be On Station.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[SUB(SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg,SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg,CamFwdRevPosDeg_Temp) ,LT(CamFwdRevPosDeg_Temp,0) ADD(CamFwdRevPosDeg_Temp,360,CamFwdRevPosDeg_Temp) ,MUL(CamFwdRevPosDeg_Temp,0.1,CamFwdRevPosDeg_Temp) ,SUB(SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg,CamFwdRevPosDeg_Temp,DialOnStaCamFwdRevBndryPosDeg) ,LT(DialOnStaCamFwdRevBndryPosDeg,0) ADD(DialOnStaCamFwdRevBndryPosDeg,360,DialOnStaCamFwdRevBndryPosDeg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Finds the Cam position where the Dial will be unlocked by the shot pin. Assumed to be half way between start and end of Index.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(DialUnlockPos,SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg + (SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg-SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg)*0.5);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[The Dial In Dwell and On Station Status Bits Are Used To Compute Dial in Sync Status : Dial must be located on a Station and main Cam cannot be in the zone where Dial Indexing Occurs.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[LIMIT(SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg,ChassisStatus.CamPosDeg,SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg)OTE(ChassisStatus.CamInDialDwell);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Dial On Station]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOD(ChassisStatus.DialPosNests,1.0,DiaPosRmndr)[LE(DiaPosRmndr,OnStationTolNests) ,SUB(1.0,OnStationTolNests,OnStaTol1Minus) GE(DiaPosRmndr,OnStaTol1Minus) ]OTE(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[At Start Stop Position]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[ADD(SetupCamStartupPosDeg,CheckStartStopPosTol,StartupPosCheckHL)[GT(StartupPosCheckHL,360) SUB(StartupPosCheckHL,360,StartupPosCheckHL) ,LE(StartupPosCheckHL,360) ]SUB(SetupCamStartupPosDeg,CheckStartStopPosTol,StartupPosCheckLL)[LT(StartupPosCheckLL,0) ABS(StartupPosCheckLL,StartupPosCheckLL) SUB(360,StartupPosCheckLL,StartupPosCheckLL) ,GE(StartupPosCheckLL,0) ]LIMIT(StartupPosCheckLL,ChassisStatus.CamPosDeg,StartupPosCheckHL)OTE(ChassisStatus.AtStartStopPos);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Moving To Pick Position]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(CamAxis_MAJ.IP)LIMIT(SetupMoveToPickLL,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,SetupMoveToPickHL)OTE(ChassisStatus.MovingToPickPos);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R03_CalcDialStationNestNums" Type="ST">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Calculate the nest number at each station positon around  the main Dial.]]>
</Description>
<STContent>
<Line Number="0">
<![CDATA[//Set nest_Num for all the Stations]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="1">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="2">
<![CDATA[//OnStationTol can cause the TRUNC value to be (Station_Qty + 1) so it was necessary to add the (Station_Qty -1) offset along with the MOD Station_Qty + 1 to correct it.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="3">
<![CDATA[//Written by W.E.H 2021-03-25. Copy From AOI -> Traking_Calc_Station_NestNums_V1_4. origionallty written by 2013-10-11 D.E.S.]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="4">
<![CDATA[//]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="5">
<![CDATA[//  All station nest numbers are calculated now instead of just 2 thru NestQty (the way it was done previously)]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="6">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="7">
<![CDATA[NewNestNum := ((TRUNC(ChassisStatus.DialPosNests + OnStationTolNests) + (p_SetupNestQty - 1)) MOD p_SetupNestQty) + 1;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="8">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="9">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="10">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="11">
<![CDATA[IF (\Tracking.p_Data.Station[1].NestNum = NewNestNum) THEN]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="12">
<![CDATA[	NestsShiftedPulse := 0;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="13">
<![CDATA[ELSE]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="14">
<![CDATA[	\Tracking.p_Data.Station[1].NestNum := NewNestNum;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="15">
<![CDATA[	NestsShiftedPulse := 1;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="16">
<![CDATA[END_IF;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="17">
<![CDATA[]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="18">
<![CDATA[FOR StaNum := 1 TO p_SetupNestQty by 1 DO]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="19">
<![CDATA[	\Tracking.p_Data.Station[StaNum].NestNum := (NewNestNum - StaNum + p_SetupNestQty) MOD p_SetupNestQty + 1;]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="20">
<![CDATA[END_FOR;]]>
</Line>
</STContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R04_StateTransitions" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Start Of State Machine]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 4: Verify Servo Enable Status]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[0])XIC(SafetyOK)XIC(iq_CamAxis.AxisHomedStatus)XIC(iq_DialAxis.AxisHomedStatus)XIO(i_HandCrank)MOVE(1000,StartupTimer.PRE)TON(StartupTimer,?,?)XIC(StartupTimer.DN)MOVE(4,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 7
Servos On, Evaluate Physical Locations (Is the Cam and Dial Syncronized?)

Conceptual Note: The Dial must be on a station position before camming can be enabled.
                                                                                                 If not, when the cam is enabled the Dial axis moves to relative positions in the cam table from its current position.
AKA- the dial will index off location.

-Resync Procedure-
If the Dial is locked by the Cam, the Cam needs to move to a position where the pin is retracted (CamUnlocPos).
The Cam can move forward or reverse to the unock position. A boundary position is chosen (CamFwdRevBndryPos) such that if the Cam's actual position is larger it will travel forward to the unloack posiiton. If the Cam actual position less then the boundary, it will reverse to the unlock position.
Reverse Zone = Unlock Position < Cam Actual Posiiton < Fwd/Rev Boundary Position 
Forward Zone =  Fwd/Rev Boundary Position < Cam Actual Posiiton < Unlock Position ]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[4]) XIC(iq_CamAxis.ServoActionStatus) XIC(iq_DialAxis.ServoActionStatus) ,XIC(Status.State[73]) XIO(CamAxisResync_MAM.IP) XIC(CamAxis_MAS.PC) XIO(DialAxisResync_MAM.IP) XIC(DialAxis_MAS.PC) ]MOVE(7,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 10: Cam Move Reverse To Unlock Position]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[7])XIC(ChassisStatus.ResyncRequired)XIC(ChassisControl.Resync)XIO(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation)XIC(ChassisStatus.CamInDialDwell)LIMIT(DialUnlockPos,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,CamFwdRevBndryPosDeg)MOVE(10,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 13: Cam Move Forward To Unlock Position]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[7])XIC(ChassisStatus.ResyncRequired)XIC(ChassisControl.Resync)XIO(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation)XIC(ChassisStatus.CamInDialDwell)LIMIT(CamFwdRevBndryPosDeg,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,DialUnlockPos)MOVE(13,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 16: Dial Move Reverse To Station if Within 0.1 Head Position, otherwise move forward to Next Station
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[7]) XIC(ChassisStatus.ResyncRequired) XIC(ChassisControl.Resync) XIO(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation) XIO(ChassisStatus.CamInDialDwell) ,[XIC(Status.State[10]) ,XIC(Status.State[13]) ] XIC(CamAxisResync_MAM.PC) XIC(CamAxisUnlockRC.InPos) ]MOVE(16,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 19: Cam Move Reverse To Dial Index Start Cam Position -1]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[7]) XIC(ChassisStatus.ResyncRequired) XIC(ChassisControl.Resync) XIC(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation) XIO(ChassisStatus.CamInDialDwell) LIMIT(SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,DialOnStaCamFwdRevBndryPosDeg) ,XIC(Status.State[16]) XIC(DialAxisResync_MAM.PC) XIC(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation) XIO(DialMoveFwdToResync) ]MOVE(19,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 22: Cam Move Forward To Dial Index Start Cam Position +1]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[7]) XIC(ChassisStatus.ResyncRequired) XIC(ChassisControl.Resync) XIC(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation) XIO(ChassisStatus.CamInDialDwell) LIMIT(DialOnStaCamFwdRevBndryPosDeg,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg) ,XIC(Status.State[16]) XIC(DialAxisResync_MAM.PC) XIC(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation) XIC(DialMoveFwdToResync) ]MOVE(22,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 25: Enable Cam Axis / Dial Axis Camming]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[7]) XIC(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation) XIC(ChassisStatus.CamInDialDwell) ,[XIC(Status.State[19]) XIC(CamAxisStartCamRC.InPos) ,XIC(Status.State[22]) XIC(CamAxisEndCamRC.InPos) ] XIC(CamAxisResync_MAM.PC) ]MOVE(25,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 28: Camming Enabled, Chassis Ready For Cycle Start]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[25]) XIC(DialAxis_MAPC.IP) XIC(iq_DialAxis.PositionCamStatus) ,[XIC(Status.State[37]) ,XIC(Status.State[55]) ] XIO(CamAxis_MAJ.IP) XIC(CamAxis_MAS.PC) ,[XIC(Status.State[40]) XIC(CamAxisCS_MAM.PC) XIC(CamAxisStartupRC.InPos) ,XIC(Status.State[43]) ] XIO(CycleRunningDelay.DN) XIO(DebugChassisAutoStart) ,XIC(Status.State[70]) XIC(iq_CamAxis.ServoActionStatus) ]MOVE(28,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 31: Chassis Auto Jog]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(CycleRunning)TON(CycleRunningDelay,?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[28]) XIC(ChassisStatus.ReadyCycleStart) [XIC(CycleRunningDelay.DN) XIO(AutoJog) XIO(AutoJoggingReady) ,XIC(DebugChassisAutoStart) ] ,XIC(Status.State[46]) MOVE(2000,Control.TransitionTime) XIC(Status.TransitionTimerDone) ]MOVE(31,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 34: Chassis Auto Jogging]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[31])XIC(CamAxis_MAJ.IP)MOVE(34,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 37: Immediate Stop (Camming Enabled)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[34]) ,XIC(Status.State[40]) ]XIC(ChassisControl.ImmedStop)MOVE(37,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 40: Controlled Stop]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[34])[XIO(CycleRunningDelay.DN) XIO(DebugChassisAutoStart) ,XIC(PauseCondition) ][SUB(SetupCamStartupPosDeg,SetupStartupStopChkSub,StartupPosLL) [GE(StartupPosLL,0) [GT(iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,SetupCamStartupPosDeg) ,LT(iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,StartupPosLL) ] ,LT(StartupPosLL,0) ADD(StartupPosLL,360,StartupPosLL) GT(iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,SetupCamStartupPosDeg) LT(iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,StartupPosLL) ] MOVE(40,Control.StateReg) ,OTE(ChassisStatus.MovingStartStopPos) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 43: Chassis Paused]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[40])XIC(CamAxisCS_MAM.PC)XIC(CamAxisStartupRC.InPos)[XIC(PauseCondition) ,[XIC(CycleRunningDelay.DN) ,XIC(DebugChassisAutoStart) ] XIO(PauseCondition) ]MOVE(43,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 46: Paused Restart Delay]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[43])XIO(PauseCondition)MOVE(46,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 49: Chassis Manual Jog]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[28])XIC(ChassisStatus.ReadyCycleStart)[XIO(CycleRunning) XIC(ManualMode) XIC(ChassisControl.JogChassis) ,XIC(CycleRunningDelay.DN) XIC(ChassisControl.AutoJogChassis) ]MOVE(49,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="18" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 52: Chassis Manual Jogging]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[49])XIC(CamAxis_MAJ.IP)MOVE(52,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="19" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 55: Stop Manual Jog]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[52])[XIO(ChassisControl.JogChassis) XIO(ChassisControl.AutoJogChassis) ,XIC(ChassisControl.ImmedStop) ,XIC(i_HandCrank) ]MOVE(55,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="20" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 58: Disable Cam Servo Drive]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[7]) [XIO(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation) ,XIO(ChassisStatus.CamInDialDwell) ] ,XIC(Status.State[28]) XIC(ChassisStatus.ReadyCycleStart) ]XIC(i_HandCrank)MOVE(58,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="21" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 61: Release Servo Brake]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[58])XIO(iq_CamAxis.ServoActionStatus)MOVE(61,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="22" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 64: Ready To Hand Crank]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[61])XIC(iq_CamAxis.MechanicalBrakeOutputStatus)MOVE(64,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="23" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 67: Engage Servo Brake]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[64])[XIO(i_HandCrank) MOVE(67,Control.StateReg) ,OTE(ChassisStatus.ReadyHandCrank) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="24" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 70: Enable Cam Servo Drive]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[67])XIO(iq_CamAxis.MechanicalBrakeOutputStatus)MOVE(70,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="25" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 73: Immediate Stop, Camming Has Not Been Enabled]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[10]) ,XIC(Status.State[13]) ,XIC(Status.State[16]) ,XIC(Status.State[19]) ,XIC(Status.State[22]) ]XIC(ChassisControl.ImmedStop)MOVE(73,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="26" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 76: Faulted, Stop All Motion]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(AlarmActive) ,XIC(IndexPermAlarmActive) ][ONS(ONS.2) LIMIT(4,Control.StateReg,99) MOVE(Control.StateReg,FaultState) MOVE(Control.StateReg,RestartState) ,XIO(Status.State[76]) XIO(Status.State[79]) XIO(Status.State[127]) MOVE(76,Control.StateReg) ,OTE(ChassisStatus.Faulted) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="27" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 79: Disable Servos]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[76])LT(iq_CamAxis.ActualVelocity,0.5)XIC(CamAxis_MAS.PC)LT(iq_DialAxis.ActualVelocity,0.5)XIC(DialAxis_MAS.PC)[XIC(iq_CamAxis.ServoActionStatus) ,XIC(iq_DialAxis.ServoActionStatus) ]MOVE(79,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="28" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 127: Chassis Faulted]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[76]) LT(iq_CamAxis.ActualVelocity,0.5) XIC(CamAxis_MAS.PC) LT(iq_DialAxis.ActualVelocity,0.5) XIC(DialAxis_MAS.PC) ,XIC(Status.State[79]) ]XIO(iq_CamAxis.ServoActionStatus)XIO(iq_DialAxis.ServoActionStatus)MOVE(127,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="29" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 0: Safety Stop]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(SafetyOK) ,XIC(S:FS) ][ONS(ONS.3) LIMIT(4,Control.StateReg,99) MOVE(Control.StateReg,SafetyStopState) MOVE(Control.StateReg,RestartState) ,MOVE(0,Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="30" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[127])XIO(ChassisStatus.Faulted)MOVE(0,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="31" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[State_Engine_128Max(StateEngine,Control,Status,StateHistory);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R05_StateLogic" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Output Status to Supervisor]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(ChassisStatus.ResyncRequired)XIC(ChassisStatus.ReadyCycleStart)OTE(q_StartOK);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[28])XIO(CamAxis_MAJ.IP)OTE(q_AutoMode);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[28])XIO(CamAxis_MAJ.IP)OTE(q_AutoStopped);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[****RUNTIME HOURS****]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(ChassisStatus.Running) ,XIC(ChassisStatus.Jogging) ,XIC(ChassisStatus.Stopping) ][MOVE(3600000,RuntimeHoursTimer.PRE) RTO(RuntimeHoursTimer,?,?) ,XIC(RuntimeHoursTimer.DN) ONS(ONS.31) ADD(ChassisStatus.RuntimeHours,1,ChassisStatus.RuntimeHours) RES(RuntimeHoursTimer) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Resync In Progress]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[10]) ,XIC(Status.State[13]) ,XIC(Status.State[16]) ,XIC(Status.State[19]) ,XIC(Status.State[22]) ]OTE(ChassisStatus.ResyncInProgress);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Ready For Cycle Start]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[28])XIO(ChassisControl.ImmedStop)OTE(ChassisStatus.ReadyCycleStart);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Running]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[31]) ,XIC(Status.State[34]) ,XIC(Status.State[43]) ,XIC(Status.State[46]) ]OTE(ChassisStatus.Running);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Stopping]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[37]) ,XIC(Status.State[40]) ]OTE(ChassisStatus.Stopping);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Jogging]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[49]) ,XIC(Status.State[52]) ,XIC(Status.State[55]) ]OTE(ChassisStatus.Jogging);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_Toggle.5)OTE(q_TaskLightsON);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R06_CamServo" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Axis Is Ready For Operation]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MotionGroup.GroupSynced)XIO(iq_CamAxis.SafeTorqueOffActiveInhibit)OTE(CamAxisReady);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(SafetyOK)XIC(CamAxisReady)TON(CamAxisEnableDelay,?,?)XIC(CamAxisEnableDelay.DN)ONS(CamAxisONS.0)OTE(CamAxisAutoEnable);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Axis Motion Permissive]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(iq_DialAxis.AxisHomedStatus)OTE(CamAxisPermissive);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Enable Axis]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(ManualMode) XIC(HMI_CamAxis.Control.Enable) XIC(CamAxisReady) ,XIC(CamAxisAutoEnable) ,XIC(Status.State[4]) ,XIC(Status.State[70]) ]XIO(iq_CamAxis.ServoActionStatus)MSO(iq_CamAxis,CamAxis_MSO);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Disable Axis]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(ManualMode) XIC(HMI_CamAxis.Control.Disable) ,XIC(Status.State[58]) ,XIC(Status.State[79]) ]MSF(iq_CamAxis,CamAxis_MSF);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Fault Reset Axis]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NE(iq_CamAxis.AxisFault,0)XIC(FaultReset)[XIO(iq_CamAxis.ShutdownStatus) MAFR(iq_CamAxis,CamAxis_MAFR) ,XIC(iq_CamAxis.ShutdownStatus) MASR(iq_CamAxis,CamAxis_MASR) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Home Axis]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ManualMode)[XIC(HMI_CamAxis.Control.HomeRequest) ONS(CamAxisONS.1) ,XIC(CamAxisHomeRequested) XIO(CamAxisHomeConfirmDelay.DN) XIO(CamAxisHomeConfimed) ]XIC(CamAxisReady)[OTE(CamAxisHomeRequested) ,TON(CamAxisHomeConfirmDelay,?,?) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ManualMode)XIC(HMI_CamAxis.Control.HomeConfirm)ONS(CamAxisONS.2)OTE(CamAxisHomeConfimed);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Home Instruction]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(CamAxisHomeConfimed)MAH(iq_CamAxis,CamAxis_MAH);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[MAM For Resync Control]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[10]) [MOVE(RotaryNegative,SetupCamResyncParameters.MoveType) ,MOVE(DialUnlockPos,SetupCamResyncParameters.Position) ] ,XIC(Status.State[13]) [MOVE(RotaryPositive,SetupCamResyncParameters.MoveType) ,MOVE(DialUnlockPos,SetupCamResyncParameters.Position) ] ,XIC(Status.State[19]) [MOVE(RotaryNegative,SetupCamResyncParameters.MoveType) ,SUB(SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg,1,DialStartIndexMinusOne) MOVE(DialStartIndexMinusOne,SetupCamResyncParameters.Position) ] ,XIC(Status.State[22]) [MOVE(RotaryPositive,SetupCamResyncParameters.MoveType) ,ADD(SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg,1,DialEndIndexPlusOne) MOVE(DialEndIndexPlusOne,SetupCamResyncParameters.Position) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(SafetyOK)[XIC(Status.State[10]) ,XIC(Status.State[13]) ,XIC(Status.State[19]) ,XIC(Status.State[22]) ]XIC(iq_CamAxis.ServoActionStatus)XIC(iq_CamAxis.AxisHomedStatus)XIC(CamAxisPermissive)MAM(iq_CamAxis,CamAxisResync_MAM,SetupCamResyncParameters.MoveType,SetupCamResyncParameters.Position,SetupCamResyncParameters.Speed,Units per sec,SetupCamResyncParameters.Accel,Units per sec2,SetupCamResyncParameters.Decel,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,0,0,Units per sec3,Disabled,Programmed,0,None,0,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[MAM For Controlled Stop]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(SafetyOK)XIC(Status.State[40])XIC(iq_CamAxis.ServoActionStatus)XIC(iq_CamAxis.AxisHomedStatus)XIC(CamAxisPermissive)MAM(iq_CamAxis,CamAxisCS_MAM,RotaryPositive,SetupCamStartupPosDeg,ChassisControl.Run.Vel,Units per sec,ChassisControl.Run.Acc,Units per sec2,ChassisControl.Run.Dec,Units per sec2,S-Curve,50,50,% of Time,Enabled,0,0,None,0,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Jog Control]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[31]) [[XIC(HMI_Toggle.0) MOVE(ChassisControl.Run.Vel,CamJogParameters.Speed) ,XIC(HMI_Toggle.1) MOVE(ChassisControlFast.Vel,CamJogParameters.Speed) ] ,MOVE(ChassisControl.Run.Acc,CamJogParameters.Accel) ,MOVE(ChassisControl.Run.Dec,CamJogParameters.Decel) ] ,XIC(Status.State[49]) [MOVE(ChassisControl.Jog.Vel,CamJogParameters.Speed) ,MOVE(ChassisControl.Jog.Acc,CamJogParameters.Accel) ,MOVE(ChassisControl.Jog.Dec,CamJogParameters.Decel) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[31]) ,XIC(Status.State[49]) ]XIC(iq_CamAxis.ServoActionStatus)XIC(CamAxisPermissive)MAJ(iq_CamAxis,CamAxis_MAJ,Forward,CamJogParameters.Speed,Units per sec,CamJogParameters.Accel,Units per sec2,CamJogParameters.Decel,Units per sec2,S-Curve,50,50,% of Time,Disabled,Programmed,0,None);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[34])XIC(CamAxis_MAJ.IP)[XIC(HMI_Toggle.0) ONS(ONS.9) MOVE(ChassisControl.Run.Vel,CamJogChangeSpeed) ,XIC(HMI_Toggle.1) ONS(ONS.10) MOVE(ChassisControlFast.Vel,CamJogChangeSpeed) ]MCD(iq_CamAxis,CamAxis_MCD,Jog,Yes,CamJogChangeSpeed,Yes,100,Yes,100,No,0,No,0,Units per sec,Units per sec2,Units per sec2,Units per sec3);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_Toggle.0)OTE(StandardSpeed_Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_Toggle.1)OTE(FastSpeed_Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Stop Control]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[[XIC(Status.State[37]) ,XIC(Status.State[73]) ,XIC(Status.State[76]) ] MOVE(ChassisControl.FastStopDec,CamAxisDecel) ,XIC(Status.State[55]) MOVE(CamJogParameters.Decel,CamAxisDecel) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="18" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[37]) ,XIC(Status.State[55]) ,XIC(Status.State[73]) ,XIC(Status.State[76]) ]MAS(iq_CamAxis,CamAxis_MAS,All,Yes,CamAxisDecel,Units per sec2,Yes,50,% of Time);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="19" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Brake Release]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[[XIC(Status.State[61]) ,XIO(SafetyOK) XIC(HMI_DisableCamBreak) ONS(ONS.19) ] MOVE(1,CamBrakeControl) ,[XIC(Status.State[67]) ,XIO(SafetyOK) XIO(HMI_DisableCamBreak) ONS(ONS.20) ] MOVE(0,CamBrakeControl) ]SSV(Axis,iq_CamAxis,MechanicalBrakeControl,CamBrakeControl);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="20" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(SafetyOK)OTU(HMI_DisableCamBreak);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="21" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Set torque]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_CamAxis.Control.SetTorquePos)MOVE(HMI_CamAxis.Parameters.TorquePos,iq_CamAxis.TorqueLimitPositive);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="22" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_CamAxis.Control.SetTorqueNeg)MOVE(HMI_CamAxis.Parameters.TorqueNeg,iq_CamAxis.TorqueLimitNegative);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="23" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Retrieve values from axis]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOVE(iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,HMI_CamAxis.Status.ActualPosition)MOVE(iq_CamAxis.ActualVelocity,HMI_CamAxis.Status.ActualVelocity)MOVE(iq_CamAxis.TorqueReferenceFiltered,HMI_CamAxis.Status.ActualTorque);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="24" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Retrieve the max values from the drive and adjust them for your application if necessary with math instructions]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(S:FS)GSV(Axis,iq_CamAxis,MaximumAcceleration,HMI_CamAxis.Status.MaxAccel)GSV(Axis,iq_CamAxis,MaximumDeceleration,HMI_CamAxis.Status.MaxDecel)GSV(Axis,iq_CamAxis,MaximumSpeed,HMI_CamAxis.Status.MaxVelocity);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="25" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Axis Position Monitor]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOn)[AOI_RangeCheck(CamAxisStartCamRC,DialStartIndexMinusOne,0.2,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,5.0) ,AOI_RangeCheck(CamAxisEndCamRC,DialEndIndexPlusOne,0.2,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,5.0) ,AOI_RangeCheck(CamAxisUnlockRC,DialUnlockPos,0.2,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,5.0) ,AOI_RangeCheck(CamAxisStartupRC,SetupCamStartupPosDeg,0.2,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,5.0) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R07_DialServo" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Axis Is Ready For Operation]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MotionGroup.GroupSynced)XIO(iq_DialAxis.SafeTorqueOffActiveInhibit)OTE(DialAxisReady);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(SafetyOK)XIC(DialAxisReady)TON(DialAxisEnableDelay,?,?)XIC(DialAxisEnableDelay.DN)ONS(DialAxisONS.0)OTE(DialAxisAutoEnable);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Axis Motion Permissive]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOn)OTE(DialAxisPermissive);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Enable Axis]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(ManualMode) XIC(HMI_DialAxis.Control.Enable) XIC(DialAxisReady) ,XIC(DialAxisAutoEnable) ,XIC(Status.State[4]) ]XIO(iq_DialAxis.ServoActionStatus)MSO(iq_DialAxis,DialAxis_MSO);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Disable Axis]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(ManualMode) XIC(HMI_DialAxis.Control.Disable) ,XIC(Status.State[79]) ]MSF(iq_DialAxis,DialAxis_MSF);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Fault Reset Axis]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NE(iq_DialAxis.AxisFault,0)XIC(FaultReset)[XIO(iq_DialAxis.ShutdownStatus) MAFR(iq_DialAxis,DialAxis_MAFR) ,XIC(iq_DialAxis.ShutdownStatus) MASR(iq_DialAxis,DialAxis_MASR) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Home Axis]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ManualMode)[XIC(HMI_DialAxis.Control.HomeRequest) ONS(DialAxisONS.1) ,XIC(DialAxisHomeRequested) XIO(DialAxisHomeConfirmDelay.DN) XIO(DialAxisHomeConfimed) ]XIC(DialAxisReady)[OTE(DialAxisHomeRequested) ,TON(DialAxisHomeConfirmDelay,?,?) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ManualMode)XIC(HMI_DialAxis.Control.HomeConfirm)ONS(DialAxisONS.2)OTE(DialAxisHomeConfimed);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Home Instruction]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(DialAxisHomeConfimed)MAH(iq_DialAxis,DialAxis_MAH);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[MAM For Resync Control]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[16])[OTU(DialMoveFwdToResync) ,TRUNC(ChassisStatus.DialPosNests,DialNearstStaPosHeads) ADD(DialNearstStaPosHeads,0.1,DialFwdRevHeadPos) GT(ChassisStatus.DialPosNests,DialFwdRevHeadPos) [ADD(DialNearstStaPosHeads,1,DialNearstStaPosHeads) ,OTL(DialMoveFwdToResync) ] ,LE(DialNearstStaPosHeads,p_SetupNestQty) CPT(DialNearstStaPosDeg,(DialNearstStaPosHeads-1)*(360.0/p_SetupNestQty)) ,GT(DialNearstStaPosHeads,p_SetupNestQty) MOVE(1,DialNearstStaPosHeads) MOVE(360.0,DialNearstStaPosDeg) ,MOVE(RotaryShortest,SetupDialResyncParameters.MoveType) MOVE(DialNearstStaPosDeg,SetupDialResyncParameters.Position) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(SafetyOK)XIC(Status.State[16])XIC(iq_DialAxis.ServoActionStatus)XIC(iq_DialAxis.AxisHomedStatus)XIC(DialAxisPermissive)MAM(iq_DialAxis,DialAxisResync_MAM,SetupDialResyncParameters.MoveType,SetupDialResyncParameters.Position,SetupDialResyncParameters.Speed,Units per sec,SetupDialResyncParameters.Accel,Units per sec2,SetupDialResyncParameters.Decel,Units per sec2,Trapezoidal,0,0,Units per sec3,Disabled,Programmed,0,None,0,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Cam To Cam Axis]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[25])NE(p_SetupNestQty,0)DIV(360.0,p_SetupNestQty,NestSpacing)[MOVE(0,CamProfileArray[0].Master) ,MOVE(0,CamProfileArray[0].Slave) ,MOVE(0,CamProfileArray[0].SegmentType) ][MOVE(SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg,CamProfileArray[1].Master) ,MOVE(0,CamProfileArray[1].Slave) ,MOVE(1,CamProfileArray[1].SegmentType) ][MOVE(SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg,CamProfileArray[2].Master) ,MOVE(NestSpacing,CamProfileArray[2].Slave) ,MOVE(0,CamProfileArray[2].SegmentType) ][MOVE(360.0,CamProfileArray[3].Master) ,MOVE(NestSpacing,CamProfileArray[3].Slave) ,MOVE(0,CamProfileArray[3].SegmentType) ]MCCP(DialAxis_MCCP,CamProfileArray,4,0,0,CamProfile)MAPC(iq_DialAxis,iq_CamAxis,DialAxis_MAPC,0,CamProfile,1,1,Continuous,Immediate,0,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,New Cam,Command,Bi-Directional);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Stop Control]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[73]) ,XIC(Status.State[76]) ]MOVE(ChassisControl.FastStopDec,DialAxisDecel);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[73]) ,XIC(Status.State[76]) ,XIC(Status.State[0]) ]MAS(iq_DialAxis,DialAxis_MAS,All,Yes,DialAxisDecel,Units per sec2,Yes,50,% of Time);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Set torque]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_DialAxis.Control.SetTorquePos)MOVE(HMI_DialAxis.Parameters.TorquePos,iq_DialAxis.TorqueLimitPositive);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_DialAxis.Control.SetTorqueNeg)MOVE(HMI_DialAxis.Parameters.TorqueNeg,iq_DialAxis.TorqueLimitNegative);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Retrieve values from axis]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOVE(iq_DialAxis.ActualPosition,HMI_DialAxis.Status.ActualPosition)MOVE(iq_DialAxis.ActualVelocity,HMI_DialAxis.Status.ActualVelocity)MOVE(iq_DialAxis.TorqueReferenceFiltered,HMI_DialAxis.Status.ActualTorque);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Retrieve the max values from the drive and adjust them for your application if necessary with math instructions]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(S:FS)GSV(Axis,iq_DialAxis,MaximumAcceleration,HMI_DialAxis.Status.MaxAccel)GSV(Axis,iq_DialAxis,MaximumDeceleration,HMI_DialAxis.Status.MaxDecel)GSV(Axis,iq_DialAxis,MaximumSpeed,HMI_DialAxis.Status.MaxVelocity);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R10_OilPump" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Turn On Oil Pump Every 30 Minutes Of Runtime For 30 Seconds]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ChassisStatus.Running)MOVE(1800000,OilPumpTimerA.PRE)RTO(OilPumpTimerA,?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(OilPumpTimerA.DN) ,XIC(OilPumpTimerB.TT) ]MOVE(30000,OilPumpTimerB.PRE)TON(OilPumpTimerB,?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(OilPumpTimerB.TT)OTE(q_OilPump);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(OilPumpTimerA.DN)RES(OilPumpTimerA);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R11_CycleTime" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calculate Cycle Time]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(CycleRunning)ADD(SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg,5.0,CamPosTrigA)Chassis_CamPos_Check(CamPosCheckA,CamPosTrigA,ChassisStatus.CamPosDeg,0,ChassisStatus.ActualVelocity)ONS(ONS.14)OTE(CycleTimeTrig);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(CycleTimeTrig)ONS(ONS.15)DIV(CycleTimer.ACC,1000,ChassisStatus.CycleTimeLast);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[25 Cycle Average]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(CycleTimeTrig)ONS(ONS.16)MovingAverage(MovingAverageA,ChassisStatus.CycleTimeLast,25,ChassisStatus.CycleTimeAverageA);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[100 Cycle Average]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(CycleTimeTrig)ONS(ONS.17)MovingAverage(MovingAverageB,ChassisStatus.CycleTimeLast,100,ChassisStatus.CycleTimeAverageB);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Last Cycle Time]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(CycleRunning)XIO(CycleTimeTrig)TON(CycleTimer,?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R20_Alarms" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Cam Servo Axis Fault]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NE(iq_CamAxis.AxisFault,0)[OTE(ServoAlarm[0].Active) ,ONS(ONS.4) DTOS(iq_CamAxis.AxisFault,CamAxisFault) CONCAT(CamAxisFaultMessage,CamAxisFault,ServoAlarm[0].Message) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Loss Of Cam Axis Absolute Home Position]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.p_sd01_CamEIP.ComOK)XIO(iq_CamAxis.AxisHomedStatus)OTE(ServoAlarm[1].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Dial Servo Axis Fault]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NE(iq_DialAxis.AxisFault,0)[OTE(ServoAlarm[2].Active) ,ONS(ONS.5) DTOS(iq_DialAxis.AxisFault,DialAxisFault) CONCAT(DialAxisFaultMessage,DialAxisFault,ServoAlarm[2].Message) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Loss Of Dial Axis Absolute Home Position]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.p_sd02_DialEIP.ComOK)XIO(iq_DialAxis.AxisHomedStatus)OTE(ServoAlarm[3].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Not Used]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOff)OTE(Alarm[0].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Not Used]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOff)OTE(Alarm[1].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Not Used]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOff)OTE(Alarm[2].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Not Used]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(g_MachineBasic.AlwaysOff)OTE(Alarm[3].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Cam Axis To Enable]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[4])MOVE(1000,Control.FaultTime);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[4]) XIO(iq_CamAxis.ServoActionStatus) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[4].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[4].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Dial Axis To Enable]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[4]) XIO(iq_DialAxis.ServoActionStatus) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[5].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[5].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Cam Resync Servo Move To Complete]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[[XIC(Status.State[10]) ,XIC(Status.State[13]) ,XIC(Status.State[19]) ,XIC(Status.State[22]) ] MOVE(10000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[6].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[6].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Dial Resync Servo Move To Complete]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[16]) MOVE(10000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[7].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[7].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Camming To Enable]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[25]) MOVE(1000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[8].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[8].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Jogging To Start]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[[XIC(Status.State[31]) ,XIC(Status.State[49]) ] MOVE(1000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[9].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[9].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Immediate Stop To Complete]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[[XIC(Status.State[37]) ,XIC(Status.State[73]) ] MOVE(1000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[10].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[10].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Controlled Stop To Complete]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[40]) MOVE(30000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[11].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[11].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Manual Jog Stop To Complete]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[55]) MOVE(2000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[12].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[12].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="18" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Cam Axis To Disable]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[[XIC(Status.State[58]) ,XIC(Status.State[79]) ] MOVE(1000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[13].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[13].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="19" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Cam Axis Brake To Release]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[61]) MOVE(1000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[14].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[14].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="20" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Cam Axis Brake To Engage]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[67]) MOVE(1000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[15].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[15].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="21" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Cam Axis To Enable]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[70]) MOVE(1000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[16].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[16].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="22" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Waiting For Dial Axis To Disable]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[79]) MOVE(1000,Control.FaultTime) XIC(Status.TimeoutFlt) ,XIC(Alarm[17].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[17].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="23" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[This is a special fault and should be used in conjunction with the fast stop deceleration value and the Check Index Permissives Cam Position (Setup_IndexPermsStartPosDeg) value. 
The basic concept is that the index permissives want to be checked at a Cam position that is a little bit before the cam position where index will occur. This is so that when an index permissive fault occurs that the cam will be able to stop rapidly enough so that it stops just before the position
when indexing occurs. If it does not, then when an index permissive fault occurs, the chassis will need to be resynced because the dial is past the dwell and should have started movement.
Set the fast stop deceleration to be fast, and find out how many degrees it takes the cam axis to stop. This value is how much before the start of index that the index permissives start check position should be set to.

NOTE: This fault will typically occur because one of the stations did not finish in time for the dail to index.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(ChassisControl.DialIndexPermsOK) [XIC(iq_DialAxis.PositionCamStatus) [XIC(iq_CamAxis.MoveStatus) ,XIC(iq_CamAxis.JogStatus) ] [LT(SetupIndexPermsStartCheckPosDeg,SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg) LIMIT(SetupIndexPermsStartCheckPosDeg,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg) ,GE(SetupIndexPermsStartCheckPosDeg,SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg) [LIMIT(SetupIndexPermsStartCheckPosDeg,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,360) ,LIMIT(0,iq_CamAxis.ActualPosition,SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg) ] ] ,[XIC(iq_DialAxis.MoveStatus) ,XIC(iq_DialAxis.JogStatus) ] ,XIO(iq_DialAxis.PositionCamStatus) [XIO(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation) ,XIO(ChassisStatus.CamInDialDwell) ] ] ,XIC(Alarm[18].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[18].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="24" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Cam & Dial NOT In Sync]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[[XIC(ChassisStatus.Running) ,XIC(ChassisStatus.Stopping) ,XIC(ChassisStatus.Jogging) ] XIC(ChassisStatus.CamInDialDwell) XIO(ChassisStatus.DialOnStation) ,XIC(Alarm[19].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[19].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="25" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[NOTE: The Permissives OK Start Check Position cannot be between the Index Start Position and Index End Position. It should be set slightly before the Index Start Position.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[LIMIT(0,SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg,SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg) LIMIT(SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg,SetupIndexPermsStartCheckPosDeg,SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg) ,LIMIT(SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg,SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg,360) [LIMIT(SetupDialIndexStartCamPosDeg,SetupIndexPermsStartCheckPosDeg,360) ,LIMIT(0,SetupIndexPermsStartCheckPosDeg,SetupDialIndexEndCamPosDeg) ] ]OTE(Alarm[20].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="26" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Hand Crank Inserted While Chassis Running
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Status.State[34]) XIC(i_HandCrank) TON(HandCrankFltDelay,?,?) XIC(HandCrankFltDelay.DN) ,XIC(Alarm[21].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[21].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="27" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[The following fault messages are used to help determine why the index permissives fault occurred. These messages are for devices that haven't completed their motion/cycle
by the time the dial needs to index. They typically are not faulted, but just slow to operate such that they interfere with the index point. ]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="28" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Index Permissive A Fault]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Alarm[18].Active) XIO(IndexPermissiveStatus[0]) ,XIC(AlarmIndexPerm[0].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(AlarmIndexPerm[0].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="29" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(AlarmIndexPerm[0].Active)ONS(ONS.6)CONCAT(AlarmIndexPermHeader,AlarmIndexPermMessages[0],AlarmIndexPerm[0].Message);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="30" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Index Permissive B Fault]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Alarm[18].Active) XIO(IndexPermissiveStatus[1]) ,XIC(AlarmIndexPerm[1].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ]OTE(AlarmIndexPerm[1].Active);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="31" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(AlarmIndexPerm[1].Active)ONS(ONS.7)CONCAT(AlarmIndexPermHeader,AlarmIndexPermMessages[1],AlarmIndexPerm[1].Message);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="32" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[****WARNING LOGIC****]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="33" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(i_HandCrank)[OTE(Alarm[30].Active) ,MOVE(1,Alarm[30].Severity) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="34" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(SafetyOK)XIC(ChassisControl.ImmedStop)[OTE(Alarm[31].Active) ,MOVE(1,Alarm[31].Severity) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="35" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(q_OilPump) XIO(i_OilFlow) MOVE(15000,OilFlowFltTimer.PRE) TON(OilFlowFltTimer,?,?) XIC(OilFlowFltTimer.DN) ,XIC(Alarm[32].Active) XIO(FaultReset) ][OTE(Alarm[32].Active) ,MOVE(1,Alarm[32].Severity) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="36" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ChassisStatus.ResyncRequired)[OTE(Alarm[33].Active) ,MOVE(1,Alarm[33].Severity) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="37" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(ChassisStatus.ResyncInProgress)[OTE(Alarm[34].Active) ,MOVE(1,Alarm[34].Severity) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="38" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Servo Alarm Handler]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[ProgramAlarmHandler(ServoAlarmHandler,\Alarms.p_ProgramID,ServoAlarm,\Alarms.p_Active,\Alarms.p_History,g_CPUDateTime,ServoAlarmActive,ServoWarningActive);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="39" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Standard Alarm Handlers]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[ProgramAlarmHandler(AOI_ProgramAlarmHandler,\Alarms.p_ProgramID,Alarm,\Alarms.p_Active,\Alarms.p_History,g_CPUDateTime,AlarmActive,WarningActive) ,ProgramAlarmHandler(AOI_ProgramAlarmIndxPermHandler,\Alarms.p_ProgramID,AlarmIndexPerm,\Alarms.p_Active,\Alarms.p_History,g_CPUDateTime,IndexPermAlarmActive,IndexPermWarningActive) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="40" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Alarm/Warning Active Outputs]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(ServoAlarmActive) ,XIC(AlarmActive) ,XIC(IndexPermAlarmActive) ]OTE(q_AlarmActive);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="41" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(ServoWarningActive) ,XIC(WarningActive) ,XIC(IndexPermWarningActive) ]OTE(q_WarningActive);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
<Program Name="HMI" TestEdits="false" MainRoutineName="R00_Main" Disabled="false" Class="Standard" UseAsFolder="false">
<Tags>
<Tag Name="CleanoutModeStopDelay" TagType="Base" DataType="TIMER" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write" OpcUaAccess="None">
<Data Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[[0,180000,0]]]>
</Data>
<Data Format="Decorated">
