<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Loss Of Dial Servo EIP]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(g_MachineBasic.PowerUpCP) EQ(EIPStatusCount,1) AOI_EIPStatus(p_sd02_DialEIP,sd02_Dial) XIO(p_sd02_DialEIP.ComOK) ,XIC(Alarm[1].Active) XIO(q_FaultReset) ]OTE(Alarm[1].Active);]]>
